# Internal linking on new pages

Whenever a new page ships (free tool, feature page, niche subpage, marketing page, or other public URL):

1. **Proactively report** whether it should be linked from:
   - the shared site Footer
   - a Related tools / RelatedToolsGrid section on other relevant pages
   - homepage hubs, blog, or other existing internal-link surfaces
2. Do this as part of finishing the page build. Do not wait to be asked.
3. Prefer adding real links only to pages that resolve (no fabricated URLs, no known 404 niche stubs unless they are intentionally live).
4. Orphaned live pages (no inbound internal links) are a crawl/discovery problem — flag them explicitly.
